  "description": "RoseLeDark.Collections.Missings — Updated Description\nA lightweight extension library providing additional generic collection types and utility structures missing in .NET.\nIncludes Array<T>, FixedArray<T>, SortedArray<T>, Map<TKey,TValue>, SortedMap<TKey,TValue>, MultiMap<TKey,TValue>, Deque<T>, RingBuffer<T>, and tuple‑like helpers such as Pair<T1,T2> and Triple<T1,T2,T3>.\n\nProvides extended numeric and color types including ColorRGB8, ColorRGB10, ColorRGB16, ColorHDR, ColorXYZ, and a unified Colors utility module.\nAdds lightweight hash implementations for non‑cryptographic scenarios, supporting deterministic hashing for engine‑oriented data structures.\n\nDesigned as a minimal, allocation‑controlled complement to .NET’s built‑in collections, focusing on predictable behavior, simple APIs, and practical data structures commonly found in other ecosystems.",
